00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.380
I've always thought New York is a place

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.000
where it's easy to get a taxi,

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.050
but it's not.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.660
Taxis were not driving by,

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.220
so I, you know, went on the apps,

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.420
I was looking at Lyft and Uber

